+
+# Rental module: equipment, quote, book
+
+Request: the booking desk needs a rental module. `src/index.ts` exports `createRentalService()`, an
+in-memory service with:
+
+- `addEquipment({ id, kind: 'board' | 'sail', dailyPrice })`
+- `quote({ itemId, start, end })` -> `{ itemId, start, end, total }`
+- `book({ itemId, start, end })` -> `{ id, itemId, start, end, total }`
+
+Rules: money is integer euro cents; times are UTC ISO-8601; periods are whole days (start and end at
+midnight UTC, end = start of the day after the last day); the same item is never booked twice for
+overlapping periods; `quote`/`book` throw for an unknown item or an invalid period, and `book` also
+throws when the item is not free. Cancellation (refund: none under 24 h before start, else full) is
+out of scope for now.
